abstract: >-
  Sol Next 9.0.3 (Dawn Orbit, ai.sol.next, Build 903) is an open-source voice+text
  multimodal Android 10-16/17 & HarmonyOS AI mobile agent built upon and paying tribute
  to wangzan101/Mika (Apache-2.0). It features free built-in DeepSeek V4.1 Flash sealed
  inside a pure-Rust JNI ChaCha20+HMAC-SHA256+HKDF vault bound to APK Sig Block v2/v3
  cert SHA-256 with TLS SPKI pinning and universal BYOK override, Wi-Fi-off persistent
  Wireless Debugging Shell Helper, built-in 16KB offline neural Chinese ASR & 112ms TTS,
  72ms Tier-0A native System APIs, 120+ app deep-link teleports, 1:1 physical-DPI
  background VirtualDisplay, Android 17 Generative UI cards, carrier-grade AI calling,
  and zero-dependency CLI (--json) + stdio MCP Server integration.
keywords:
